#: inc/collection-content.php:33
msgid "Black Rose Collection — rose from concrete"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:34
msgid "The beauty of the color black through the rose and high-end fashion design."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:35
msgid "Monochrome sophistication. Dark-on-dark texture. Elegance distilled into every fiber. You don't wear it to stand out. You wear it because you already stood up."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:36
#: inc/collection-content.php:214
msgid "Discover"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:37
#: inc/collection-content.php:215
msgid "View 3D Experience"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:40
#: inc/collection-content.php:50
#: inc/collections-config.php:40
msgid "Dark Elegance"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:41
msgid "Quiet Authority"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:44
msgid "From the Concrete"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:45
msgid "Born from a Single Question"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:46
msgid "Someone asked who Black Rose was for. The answer came before the question finished: a black rose is a posture. Not a flower — a conviction. In Oakland, where concrete is the only soil that matters, beauty doesn't ask for permission. It forces its way through the cracks."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:47
msgid "\"They said luxury can't come from the Town. We said watch. Every piece in Black Rose is the concrete answering back.\""
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:48
msgid "Black Rose is what happens when you stop apologizing for where you're from. Monochrome because silence speaks louder. Dark-on-dark because depth is earned, not given. These aren't clothes that announce themselves — they command presence the way Oakland taught us. Quiet. Unshakable."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:49
msgid "BLACK ROSE"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:52
msgid "\"Where I'm from, black isn't a color — it's armor. Every kid on my block knew that. Black Rose is that truth made into fabric. You don't wear it to stand out. You wear it because you already stood up.\""
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:53
#: inc/collection-content.php:231
msgid "Corey Foster, Oakland"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:54
msgid "The Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:55
msgid "Every stitch, every detail is designed to empower you to move through the world on your own terms."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:59
msgid "Monochrome Mastery"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:60
msgid "The depth of black carries what other colors cannot — layered textures, tonal contrasts, silhouettes that command presence without raising their voice."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:62
msgid "Black Rose hockey jersey — layered black-on-black texture"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:68
msgid "The Thorn Motif"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:69
msgid "Resilience encoded in every stitch. The thorn represents protective beauty — guarding what is precious while standing its ground."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:71
msgid "Moonlit courtyard rose garden — the Black Rose world"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:77
msgid "Dark-on-Dark Texture"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:78
msgid "This is not loud fashion. This is the quiet authority of someone who knows exactly who they are. Elegance distilled into every fiber."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:80
msgid "Night gazebo scene — dark-on-dark depth"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:85
msgid "Dark elegance — holographic preview"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:86
msgid "Wear the Darkness"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:87
msgid "The thorn protects what the world tries to take. Every piece in Black Rose carries that Oakland lesson: be beautiful, be sharp, never be soft where it counts."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:88
#: patterns/collection-hero-black-rose.php:39
msgid "Shop Black Rose"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:89
msgid "First access to new drops, behind-the-scenes stories, and the darkness behind each piece."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:93
msgid "01 — THE POSTURE"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:94
msgid "Not a flower —"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:95
msgid "a conviction."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:96
msgid "Black Rose / Oakland"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:99
msgid "02 — THE ANSWER"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:100
msgid "Every piece in Black Rose is"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:101
msgid "the concrete answering back."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:102
msgid "Black Rose / The Town"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:105
msgid "03 — THE STAND"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:106
msgid "You wear it because"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:107
msgid "you already stood up."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:108
msgid "Black Rose / Collection I"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:115
#: inc/collection-content.php:129
#: inc/collection-content.php:134
#: inc/collection-content.php:139
msgid "The Hurts Bloodline"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:122
msgid "Love Hurts Collection — enchanted rose under glass"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:123
msgid "They called me Beast. They were right."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:124
msgid "But even the Beast kept a rose under glass — protecting the most fragile thing he ever loved. This collection carries the weight of three generations of Hurts."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:126
msgid "Enter the 3D Experience"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:130
msgid "Love Is Worth the Pain"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:133
msgid "The Bloodline"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:135
msgid "My grandmother used to say it plain: \"Love hurts, baby. That's how you know it's real.\" She wasn't being poetic. She was teaching survival. Three generations of Hurts women and men poured everything into the people they loved — and the world poured pain right back. But they never stopped loving. Not once."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:136
msgid "\"The Beast didn't hide because he was ugly. He hid because he loved something so beautiful it terrified him. The rose under glass — that's every Hurts who ever kept loving when love didn't love them back.\""
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:137
msgid "This collection carries grandmother's name. Not as a brand, but as a bloodline truth. Every stitch holds the weight of family dinners where we laughed through grief, of front porches where grandmama told stories while pressing creases into Sunday shirts."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:138
msgid "LOVE HURTS"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:141
msgid "\"Every petal that falls is a lesson. Every thorn is a boundary. The enchanted rose doesn't die — it transforms. Just like us.\""
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:142
msgid "From Grit to Grace"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:143
msgid "The Emotional Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:144
msgid "Crimson for the blood we share. Deep purple for the bruises that became wisdom. Burgundy for the wine grandmama poured when she said, \"Baby, you survived another one.\""
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:148
msgid "Beast's Vulnerability"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:149
msgid "Strength isn't the roar. It's the silence after — when you choose to stay open instead of closing off. These pieces honor the courage it takes to be soft in a world that rewards hardness."
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:151
msgid "The Beast and the rose — Love Hurts hero artwork"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:157
msgid "The Enchanted Rose"
msgstr ""

#: inc/collection-content.php:158
msgid "Protected under glass, glowing in a dark room, losing petals one by one. The rose is every love worth fighting for — fragile and fierce at the same time."
msgstr ""

